---
import { getPortalStats, statPlus } from '../lib/portalStats';
const __ps = await getPortalStats();
const plAgents = statPlus(__ps.agents, 'en');
const plAgencies = statPlus(__ps.agencies, 'en');
const plListings = statPlus(__ps.listings, 'en');
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const origin = 'https://info.propertylist.es';
const canonical = `${origin}/about-us/`;
const title = 'About PropertyList • PropertyList Info Hub';
const description = 'Built for agents - not to compete with them. PropertyList combines MLS efficiency, CRM workflows, and public portal visibility.';
---

<Layout
	lang="en"
	title={title}
	description={description}
	canonical={canonical}
	hreflangs={[
		{ hreflang: 'en', href: 'https://info.propertylist.es/about-us/' },
		{ hreflang: 'es', href: 'https://info.propertylist.es/es/sobre-nosotros/' },
		{ hreflang: 'x-default', href: 'https://info.propertylist.es/about-us/' },
	]}
>
	<section class="hero">
		<div class="heroInner">
			<div class="kicker">About PropertyList</div>
			<h1>Built for Agents. Not to Compete With Them.</h1>
			<p class="lead">
				For years, you have been forced to operate within a broken system. You pay exorbitant subscription fees to corporate platforms, only to watch
				them use your own data against you. Listings are duplicated or not real, marketing budgets are stretched to the limit, and the very leads you
				work hard to generate are often sold right back to your competitors.
			</p>
			<p class="subLead">It is time to take your power back.</p>
			<p class="subLead">
				PropertyList was created with one uncompromising belief: real estate agents should not have to fund the platforms that are actively trying to
				replace them. We are redefining real estate by delivering the industry’s first-ever fusion of true MLS efficiency and high-level property
				portal visibility.
			</p>
			<div class="ctaRow" aria-label="Get started">
				<a class="btnPrimary" href="https://agents.propertylist.es/new_agency/new?locale=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
					Agents: Get Started FREE
				</a>
				<a class="btnSecondary" href="https://developers.propertylist.es/signup/new" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
					Developers: Get Started FREE
				</a>
			</div>
			<div class="note">No credit card required.</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<div class="grid2">
			<div class="card">
				<h2>Why We Exist</h2>
				<p>
					We looked at the modern real estate landscape and refused to accept the status quo. We saw:
				</p>
				<ul class="list">
					<li>Agents paying thousands per year with absolutely zero platform loyalty in return.</li>
					<li>A complete lack of a centralised, tech-forward infrastructure built exclusively for the agent network.</li>
					<li>Rigid, locked-in contracts designed to trap agencies rather than help them grow.</li>
					<li>Corporate portals hijacking exclusive mandates just to sell the leads back to the highest bidder.</li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<div class="card accent">
				<h2>What We Built</h2>
				<p>
					Instead of adding another expensive trap to the market, we built a strategic infrastructure designed to give you absolute control.
				</p>
				<div class="pillRow" aria-label="Platform pillars">
					<span class="pill">Smart MLS</span>
					<span class="pill">Automated CRM</span>
					<span class="pill">Public Portal</span>
					<span class="pill">Pay-as-you-go Credits</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<div class="sectionHead">
			<h2>The Agent-First Approach</h2>
			<p>
				PropertyList is engineered to protect your pipeline, not drain your marketing budget. We empower real estate professionals by providing a
				comprehensive Smart MLS and automated CRM free of charge at its core - with unlimited property uploads, unlimited staff accounts, and
				absolutely no hidden fees, no setup fees and no cancelation fees.
			</p>
			<p class="subHead">We operate on a foundation of absolute transparency:</p>
		</div>

		<div class="grid3" aria-label="Agent-first commitments">
			<div class="card">
				<h3>You own your listings</h3>
				<p>
					We guarantee an exclusive protection window for every buyer lead generated from the PropertyList.es Public Portal on your specific listing
					mandate. Unlike traditional portals, we will never instantly hijack your hard-earned buyer and sell them to the highest bidder. You hold
					the exclusive first right to open and claim that direct lead, and opening it costs nothing today.
				</p>
				<p class="muted">
					To maintain a high standard of service for property seekers, if a lead remains unopened and inactive for 5 working days, our automated
					system will redirect the buyer to a duplicate or similar property to ensure their inquiry is answered. Your active leads and your listings
					remain strictly in your control.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="card">
				<h3>A collaborative New Development network</h3>
				<p>
					We actively partner with property developers, allowing them to list their projects on our infrastructure at absolutely no cost. This feeds
					high-value, commissionable inventory directly into your network for you to sell, while our public portal operates as an independent channel
					to drive massive market exposure.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="card">
				<h3>You only pay for what you use</h3>
				<p>
					We have eliminated tied contracts, setup fees, cancellation fees, and hidden costs. You operate on a flexible, pay-as-you-go credit system.
					You only invest when you strategically choose to unlock premium tools, such as featuring listings or generating AI-powered market reports. Opening a
					direct lead from the public portal is free for a limited time.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<div class="grid2">
			<div class="card">
				<h2>Our Vision &amp; Mission: A Complete Real Estate Ecosystem</h2>
				<p>
					At PropertyList, we are on a mission to revolutionise the housing market - creating an inclusive space where everyone discovers quality
					homes, receives unwavering support, and accesses top-rated services. Our commitment is to seamlessly connect buyers, sellers, renters, and
					Estate Agents.
				</p>
				<p>
					But we are not stopping there. We are building a comprehensive digital ecosystem that connects you directly with essential property
					professionals and tradesmen, including lawyers, architects, plumbers, and dedicated builders.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="card">
				<h2>Innovation That Helps You Win</h2>
				<p>
					We are also constantly exploring new technological frontiers. From cutting-edge AI solutions to streamlined automation and smart funnels,
					we are dedicated to elevating the real estate experience and giving you the ultimate competitive advantage.
				</p>
				<div class="statGrid" aria-label="Platform stats">
					<div class="stat">
						<div class="statNum">{plAgencies}</div>
						<div class="statLabel">Agencies</div>
					</div>
					<div class="stat">
						<div class="statNum">{plAgents}</div>
						<div class="statLabel">Active agents</div>
					</div>
					<div class="stat">
						<div class="statNum">{plListings}</div>
						<div class="statLabel">Active listings</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section cta">
		<div class="ctaInner">
			<h2>Join the Movement</h2>
			<p>
				The industry is shifting, and the smartest agencies are already securing their positions. Today, PropertyList is trusted by {plAgencies} agencies
				and {plAgents} active agents across Spain, with {plListings} properties actively listed.
			</p>
			<p>
				If you are ready to step into a professional network designed to protect your deals, reduce your costs, and amplify your success - rather
				than compete with you - you are exactly where you need to be.
			</p>
			<div class="ctaRow" aria-label="Join PropertyList">
				<a class="btnPrimary" href="https://agents.propertylist.es/new_agency/new?locale=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
					Agents Get Started FREE - No Credit Card Required
				</a>
				<a class="btnSecondary" href="https://developers.propertylist.es/signup/new" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
					Developers Get Started FREE - No Credit Card Required
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	:global(:root) {
		--pl-accent: #00ae9a;
		--pl-accent-rgb: 0, 174, 154;
	}

	h1,
	h2,
	h3 {
		letter-spacing: -0.03em;
	}

	.hero {
		border-radius: 22px;
		padding: 16px;
		margin: 0 0 16px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.08);
		background:
			radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 20% -10%, rgba(var(--pl-accent-rgb), 0.22), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0)),
			radial-gradient(900px 500px at 90% 10%, rgba(var(--pl-accent-rgb), 0.12), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0));
	}

	.heroInner {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
		border: 1px solid rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.06);
		border-radius: 18px;
		padding: 18px;
	}

	.kicker {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 8px;
		padding: 6px 10px;
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: rgba(var(--pl-accent-rgb), 0.12);
		border: 1px solid rgba(var(--pl-accent-rgb), 0.22);
		color: rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.86);
		font-weight: 900;
		font-size: 12px;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	h1 {
		margin: 10px 0 10px;
		line-height: 1.06;
	}

	.lead {
		margin: 0 0 14px;
		color: rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.75);
		max-width: 78ch;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.subLead {
		margin: 0 0 12px;
		color: rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.74);
		max-width: 90ch;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.note {
		color: rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.65);
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 13px;
	}

	.section {
		margin: 0 0 14px;
	}

	.sectionHead {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
		border: 1px solid rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.08);
		border-radius: 18px;
		padding: 14px;
		margin-bottom: 12px;
	}

	.sectionHead p {
		margin: 8px 0 0;
		color: rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.72);
		line-height: 1.6;
		max-width: 88ch;
	}

	.subHead {
		margin: 10px 0 0;
		color: rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.68);
		font-weight: 800;
	}

	.grid2 {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 12px;
	}

	.grid3 {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 12px;
	}

	.card {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86);
		border: 1px solid rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.08);
		border-radius: 18px;
		padding: 14px;
	}

	.card.accent {
		border-color: rgba(var(--pl-accent-rgb), 0.25);
		background:
			linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(var(--pl-accent-rgb), 0.08), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86)),
			rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86);
	}

	.card h2 {
		margin: 0 0 10px;
	}

	.card h3 {
		margin: 0 0 8px;
		font-size: 16px;
	}

	.card p {
		margin: 0 0 10px;
		color: rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.78);
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.muted {
		color: rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.62);
		font-size: 13px;
		margin-top: 10px;
	}

	.list {
		margin: 0;
		padding-left: 18px;
		color: rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.78);
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.pillRow {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 8px;
		margin-top: 12px;
	}

	.pill {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 8px 10px;
		border-radius: 999px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(var(--pl-accent-rgb), 0.22);
		background: rgba(var(--pl-accent-rgb), 0.1);
		font-weight: 900;
		color: rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.86);
		font-size: 13px;
	}

	.statGrid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 10px;
		margin-top: 12px;
	}

	.stat {
		border: 1px solid rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.08);
		background: rgba(247, 248, 250, 0.7);
		border-radius: 16px;
		padding: 12px;
	}

	.statNum {
		font-weight: 950;
		font-size: 22px;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		color: rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.92);
	}

	.statLabel {
		margin-top: 4px;
		color: rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.66);
		font-weight: 800;
		font-size: 12px;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.cta {
		border-radius: 22px;
		padding: 16px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(var(--pl-accent-rgb), 0.22);
		background: radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 30% 0%, rgba(var(--pl-accent-rgb), 0.18), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0));
	}

	.ctaInner {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
		border: 1px solid rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.06);
		border-radius: 18px;
		padding: 16px;
	}

	.ctaInner p {
		margin: 8px 0 0;
		color: rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.75);
		line-height: 1.6;
		max-width: 90ch;
	}

	.ctaRow {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 10px;
		margin-top: 14px;
	}

	.btnPrimary,
	.btnSecondary {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		padding: 12px 14px;
		border-radius: 14px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.14);
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 950;
		color: rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.88);
	}

	.btnPrimary {
		border-color: rgba(var(--pl-accent-rgb), 0.35);
		background: rgba(var(--pl-accent-rgb), 0.14);
	}

	.btnPrimary:hover,
	.btnSecondary:hover {
		border-color: rgba(var(--pl-accent-rgb), 0.45);
	}

	@media (max-width: 980px) {
		.grid3 {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 860px) {
		.grid2 {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
		.statGrid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
